@startuml pkm-des-account-claim-sequence
autonumber
actor Student
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Next.js App" as App
participant "Server Action" as Action
participant "Supabase Client" as Supabase
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Email Service" as Email
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Student -> Browser : Enters Claim Details (ID, Email, Type)
Browser -> App : Finds Official Record
App -> Supabase : Queries official_student_records
Supabase -> DB : Select
DB --> Supabase : Returns Record
Supabase --> App : Record Data
App --> Browser : Displays Masked Record

Student -> Browser : Submits New Password
Browser -> Action : createStudentAccountAction(payload, signedProof)
Action -> Action : Verifies Signed Claim Proof (HMAC)
Action -> Supabase : Checks for duplicate account
Supabase -> DB : Queries students / profiles
DB --> Supabase : Returns null (No duplicate)

Action -> Auth : signUp(email, password)
Auth -> Auth : Creates auth.users row
Auth --> Action : Session & User ID
note right of Auth: Cleanup on failure happens if\nDB steps below fail.

Action -> Supabase : RPC create_student_account(user_id, role, name, email...)
Supabase -> DB : Executes atomic RPC
DB -> DB : Inserts into profiles
DB -> DB : Inserts into students
DB --> Supabase : Success
Supabase --> Action : Result

Action --> Browser : Success / Redirect to Login

@enduml
